WEBVTT

NOTE
Visual descriptions of the silent landing-page edition.
These are descriptions of the picture, not dialogue captions.

opening
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
A glossy pink Fleshsesh wordmark and gold ACADEMY lettering
appear on black beside animated pink lips.

solo
00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:06.542
In a room lit with pink and blue neon, a performer poses
in a glossy black outfit as the camera moves closer.

portraits
00:00:06.542 --> 00:00:09.375
Quick cuts show other performers posing,
close-ups of makeup, and lip gloss being applied.

group
00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:12.500
The camera widens to a group posing in glossy black
and metallic outfits in the neon-lit room.

closing
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.042
The group fades away. The pink Fleshsesh wordmark
and gold ACADEMY lettering return on black.
